      "premise": "In a village where the sky holds no stars and only a cold mist drifts, a young girl wanders lost. There, she encounters a silver fox carrying an ancient star chart upon its back. Together, they embark on a journey to find the star fragments slumbering within the \"Ice Castle\"—a place whispered to be a failed creation of the gods. But the castle is a terrifying realm, one that turns a visitor's most precious memories into ice to devour them."
